  "details": "Issue:\n\nDue to the new long press feature on the action wheel, if you try to select an input that the game considers longer than a short press, but shorter than a long press (i.e. the gear indicator being only half full), vrchat will register neither action, causing nothing to happen. \n\nExpected Behavior:\n\nThere should not be a duration in between a short press or a long press that does nothing, and I would expect the game to consider it a short press, since i did not hold the button long enough to be considered a long press.",
